  go-pdfium embeds a WebAssembly build of PDFium in webassembly/pdfium.wasm.
  PDFium is BSD-3-Clause: that is what the LICENSE in the upstream PDFium
  repository says, and it agrees with docs/adr/0025-licence-policy.md.
  go-pdfium's own README describes PDFium as Apache-2.0, which appears to be
  mistaken; both licences are permitted here, so nothing turns on it, but the
  upstream file is the authority and it is the one followed above.


